Changes made to the source work (Apache-2.0 section 4(b)):
- The book's prose was restructured into slides and in places shortened or
  reworded to fit a slide; explanations, code listings and the compiler
  output the text discusses are kept.
- Code listings are shown as the online book displays them (lines that mdBook
  hides are omitted); some long listings are split across slides, some long
  output lines are wrapped, and some repetitive compiler output is elided
  with "...".
- Figures were redrawn as HTML/SVG diagrams; some screenshots are described
  in text instead.
- Some summary tables, examples and remarks were added; they are marked as
  numbered Table/Example/Remark blocks on the slides.
- Definitions, tables and listings were renumbered per chapter.

